s=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/791260/extras/c7ec27fe4a2ce3d8125d029299294a6e.avif?t=1748532092\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the quiet fishing village, Kome. Storylines and side quests are just some of the things you can do here.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/791260/extras/33d6d4a6cf19b0b3e68b2a7230277f4e.avif?t=1748532092\" /></div></p>",
